      "result": "{\"game_seq\":347,\"action_type\":\"GAME_SELECT\",\"stop_reason\":\"playable_cards\",\"response_type\":\"select\",\"untapped_lands\":5,\"message\":\"Play spells and abilities\",\"action_pending\":true,\"land_drops_used\":0,\"has_playable_cards\":true,\"context\":\"T7 Precombat Main/Precombat Main (MstLg Trash) YOUR_MAIN\",\"recent_chat\":[\"Grok4F Villain: From the depths of my volcanic lair, another Mountain erupts into existence! Feel the earth quake as my domain expands, fueling the fires of my ultimate conquest. Your time draws near, fool\\u0026mdash;resistance is futile! Mwahahaha!\",\"Grok4F Villain: Awaken, Living Lightning, my electrified enforcer! Surge forth from the storm clouds of my malevolent design, adding your thunderous might to my legion of doom! With this new minion, your downfall accelerates\\u0026mdash;prepare to be shocked into submission! Mwahahaha!\",\"Grok4F Villain: Homing Lightning, strike true from the heart of my tempestuous arsenal! Let this bolt of retribution obliterate your wretched Magmutt, clearing the path for my minions\\u0026#39; onslaught. Witness the precision of my dark machinations\\u0026mdash;your artifacts and dreams alike shall shatter! Mwahahaha!\",\"Grok4F Villain: Charge, my loyal minions\\u0026mdash;Lightning Visionary and Shambling Suit! Pierce the veil of your pathetic resistance, delivering the shock and crush that heralds the dawn of my eternal reign! With every step, your life ebbs away, just as my master plan dictates. Cackle with me in your impending doom! Mwahahaha!\",\"Grok4F Villain: Lightning Visionary, direct your electric fury upon that meddlesome Chandra! Zap the very life from her loyal counters, weakening her infernal influence within my grand scheme. One step closer to total domination! Mwahahaha!\",\"Grok4F Villain: Now, Shambling Suit and Filigree Attendant, join the fray! March forth, my mechanical monstrosities, and lay siege to the heart of my enemy\\u0026#39;s forces. With Lightning Visionary already zapping that fiery interloper, your combined assault will crack the foundations of their resistance. Behold the unstoppable tide of my villainous vanguard\\u0026mdash;victory is but a strike away! Mwahahaha!\",\"Grok4F Villain: Shambling Suit, lumber forward and smash into that infernal Chandra once more! Crush her remaining essence beneath your artifact-forged fists, extinguishing her fiery meddling forevermore. This strike ensures her sparks fade into oblivion, all according to my meticulously crafted apocalypse! Mwahahaha!\",\"Grok4F Villain: And finally, Filigree Attendant, take to the skies and dive upon that blazing Chandra with your metallic fury! Together, my trio of terrors shall overwhelm her defenses, reducing her to ashes and removing her from the equation of my inevitable triumph. The pieces fall into place\\u0026mdash;your defeat is scripted! Mwahahaha!\",\"Grok4F Villain: Filigree Attendant, soar high and strike at Chandra\\u0026#39;s core! With my Visionary\\u0026#39;s bolts and the Suit\\u0026#39;s relentless pounding, your aerial assault seals her fate. The planeswalker crumbles under the weight of my orchestrated onslaught\\u0026mdash;another pawn falls in my symphony of destruction! Mwahahaha!\",\"Grok4F Villain: Yes! Let the assault commence! My minions descend upon Chandra like vultures on carrion, their combined might overwhelming her in a blaze of glory and ruin. This was always part of the plan\\u0026mdash;watch as your planeswalker ally flickers out, leaving you exposed and alone in the shadow of my supremacy! Mwahahaha!\"],\"respond_with\":\"choice\\u003dpN to play, or choice\\u003dno to pass\",\"board_cursor\":25,\"choices\":[{\"name\":\"Chandra\\u0027s Magmutt\",\"index\":0,\"action\":\"activate\",\"playable_abilities\":[\"{T}: {this} deals 1 damage to target player or pl...\"],\"id\":\"p11\"},{\"mana_cost\":\"{1}{R}\",\"name\":\"Chandra\\u0027s Magmutt\",\"index\":1,\"action\":\"cast\",\"id\":\"p58\",\"power\":\"2